== Trivia ==
* {{dlc+|a}} This item is used in {{chal|Have a Heart}}.{{dlc-}}
* A [[wikipedia:vampire|vampire]] is a being from folklore who subsists by feeding on the life essence (generally in the form of blood) of the living.
** In folklore, a vampire leaves no reflection because it has no soul. {{dlc|r}} This is why Charm of the Vampire removes Isaac's reflections in the water/blood visible in some floors.
* If an enemy dies while Isaac is [[Death|dying]], Charm of the Vampire can still heal him, leaving him dead with half a Red Heart.

